<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 11.99 bln ATS in quick repo.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 11.99 bln ATS in quick repo.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Wednesday it had allocated 11.99 billion schillings in a quick repo at a fixed rate of 3.00 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 18 percent of bids were filled. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
</text>
